{"arguments":{"doc":"d1"},"at":4,"case":"transcripts/w3-figures-update#1","event":"call","outputs":[],"result":{"app":{},"changed":[],"checks":{},"created":[],"data":"<!-- p:5FCB534E -->\n# Regional sales update, 2026\n\n<!-- p:4C32E1FB -->\nTo: Management team. From: Sales Operations.\n\n<!-- p:16425160 -->\nYear-to-date sales across our three regions reached EUR 41.6 million. North remains the largest region at EUR 16.1 million. Q3 was the strongest quarter, at EUR 14.5 million.\n\n<!-- p:3B212964 -->\n## Sales by region and quarter\n\n<!-- p:12972045 -->\nAll figures in EUR million.\n\n<!-- t:60D6847F table style: Table Grid -->\n| Region | Q1 | Q2 | Q3 | Total |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| North | 5.2 | 5.4 | 5.5 | 16.1 |\n| South | 3.9 | 4.1 | 4.3 | 12.3 |\n| West | 4.0 | 4.5 | 4.7 | 13.2 |\n| Total | 13.1 | 14.0 | 14.5 | 41.6 |\n\n<!-- p:55291651 -->\n## Chart\n\n<!-- p:30AEBD05 -->\nThe chart below shows each region's sales by quarter.\n\n<!-- p:7246E0D2 d:1 chart \"Chart 1\" [chart: bar; title: Sales by region (EUR million); series: North, South, West; categories: Q1, Q2, Q3] empty -->\n\n<!-- p:05F235FF -->\n## Next steps\n\n<!-- p:3B981BD3 -->\nRegional managers will present their plans for next year at the November meeting.\n","doc":"d1","next_cursor":null,"ok":true,"removed":[],"renamed":{},"summary":"Read the document (final)","total":1059,"version":0,"warnings":[]},"tool":"word_read"}
